docs {
  ## List Celcom Senders

  Bruno: `admin/List Celcom Senders`

  Lists every registered Celcom shortcode (active and revoked), including its current `apiKey`
  and `partnerId` in plaintext.

  Code source: `CelcomSenderControllerImpl.getAllCelcomSenders` / `CelcomSenderServiceImpl.getAllCelcomSenders`.
}
